```php
add_filter('rest_pre_dispatch', function ($server) {
    $origin = ( is_array( $_SERVER['HTTP_ORIGIN'] ) ) ? $_SERVER['HTTP_ORIGIN'][0] : $_SERVER['HTTP_ORIGIN'];
    header("Access-Control-Allow-Origin: {$origin}");
    return $server;
});
```

5. Set up headers in your Next.js app:
To avoid making requests with credentials, update the `fetch` function in your Next.js project by adding the following options:

