\section*{English Version}

\subsection*{Description of Technical Issue}
We have encountered an unexpected issue during the integration of a third-party API into our multi-tiered system architecture. When attempting to make a request to the API using our application, we receive the following error message:

\verb|Error 500: Internal Server Error|

Additionally, the server logs indicate the following error:

\verb|[ERROR] [api_gateway.log]: Request handling failed; java.lang.NullPointerException: null|

This issue occurs intermittently, but it appears to affect approximately 5\% of all requests made to the API through our application. The root cause of this problem is currently unknown.

\subsection*{System Architecture}
Our system architecture consists of the following components:

\begin{table}[h!]
\centering
\caption{System Architecture Diagram}
\label{tab:architecture}
\begin{tabular}{|c|c|}
