\hline
Backend Services & Business logic and data processing \\
\hline
Third-Party API & External service used for specific functionality \\
\hline
Database & Data storage and retrieval \\
\hline
\end{tabular}
\end{table}

The issue seems to originate from the API Gateway component when interacting with the third-party API. Specifically, the error occurs during the authentication process when making a request to the API.

\subsection*{Proposed Solution}
To resolve the issue, we propose implementing a fallback mechanism that allows our application to use an alternative third-party API if the primary one fails. This would help minimize disruption to users

